name two_way_turns_loss_5pct
describe Two-way call with scripted turns, 5% random loss each way on a 100 ms RTT link: the user's speech reaching the AI (#755)
duration 30s
call two-way
turn user 1s-5s
turn ai after=800ms len=4s
turn user 11s-15s
turn ai after=600ms len=4s
turn user 20s-23s
barge-in at 25s len=1500ms
at 0s capacity=2500kbps delay=50ms queue=300ms loss=5%
reverse at 0s capacity=2500kbps delay=50ms queue=300ms loss=5%
# program.md 6.3 sev:2 (conversation): on a 100 ms RTT link with <= 5% loss, at most 2% of the user's speech lost
# or concealed on the way to the AI.
expect conv.user_speech_lost_pct <= 2
expect up.audio.interruptions == 0
